This project is a non-commercial, free-to-play fan project created strictly for educational, learning, and portfolio purposes. 
The swinging mechanics are inspired by the Marvel universe. All rights to the original characters, names, and trademarked concepts belong to their respective owners. 
No copyright infringement is intended.

The project was made using Unity and was intended for an Oculus Quest 2

Trigger for swinging and Secondary Trigger for Grapple
